  articleID: https://NUSA/Updates/quotes
  title: Presidential Taunt
  headliner: <b>Former President  Taunts Assassins At Rally, Dares Them To "Try Again"</b>
  bodyText: "Refusing to tone down his trademark bravado just days after surviving
    a second close call on his West Palm Beach golf course, former N.U.S.A. President
    Ronald Dump took the stage at a packed campaign rally tonight and openly dared
    his would-be assassins to take another shot. \r\n\r\nMore about this story :"
  externalLinkBodyText: "\"Look, they tried once, they missed, totally missed, by
    the way, terrible aim, folks, truly pathetic,\" \r\n\r\nDump told the roaring
    crowd, waving a hand dismissively. \r\n\r\n\"Then they come to my golf course,
    beautiful course, best greens in the country, everybody says so, and they fail
    again! So I say to the losers and the haters: go ahead, try a third time! See
    what happens! Nobody dodges better than Ronald Dump, believe me!\" \r\n"
  hasExternalLink: 1
  customComments:
  - You guys do know the comments are monitored right ?
  - Now why would you goad them like that ?
  - I'm down to try again if yall are.
  - "I mean if you insist i wont say no\u2026"
